## Summary of Implementation (I3.T2)

I've successfully completed the major phases of Task I3.T2. Here's what has been implemented:

### ✅ Completed Phases:

**Phase 1**: Read and analyzed existing OpenAPI spec structure and Cart/Order/Checkout schemas

**Phase 2**: Added comprehensive OpenAPI annotations to OrderResource.java:
- All 7 endpoints now have complete OpenAPI documentation
